RdEndPointConfig	(Local PCI) for Segment:0, Bus(8)/Device(3)/Function(0), Register: 0x1CC
RdEndPointConfig	(MMIO via BDF) for Segment:0xff, Bus(s3m_bus)/Device(0)/Function(1), Address: S3M_FLOW_STATUS 0x200
WrEndPointConfig	(MMIO via BDF) for Segment:0xff, Bus(s3m_bus)/Device(0)/Function(1), Register: S3M_COMMAND 0x208, s3m_command: SSKU_REGION_READ 0x10
RdEndPointConfig	(MMIO via BDF) for Segment:0xff, Bus(s3m_bus)/Device(0)/Function(1), Address: S3M_FLOW_STATUS 0x200
RdEndPointConfig	(MMIO via BDF) for Segment:0xff, Bus(s3m_bus)/Device(0)/Function(1), Address: S3M_BIOS_W_DATA_OUTPUT_REG_CONFIG = 0x2B0
